Cell["\<\
Initialize graphene with the original version and display its onsite \
Hamiltonian. Run this example in a kernel that loads only MagneticTBOld`:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e41013f0-6066-4ada-97e3-59a06f859fc3"],

